# Gather-control score: yellow, top/right/left cushions, then red, with all three final centers within 16.3 in.
# Source: whitepapers/the_art_of_billiards_play.html (position play and gathering are core carom tactics).
# Goal: couple a legal three-cushion route to the positional leave instead of validating the score alone.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (1.520000, 6.288000)
ball yellow at (2.605000, 6.215000)
ball red at (0.746504730, 1.909159743)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(60)
trace(max_events: 60)
shot(cue).heading(91.420508904deg).speed(176.511603754ips).tip(side: 0.322240094R, height: 0.201772351R).elevation(4.005040902deg).using(default)
